# Hyperfine-structure (and, for Cu, isotopic) components of the Mn I and Cu I
# lines in lines_ab.dat, for MOOG's `blends` driver.
#
# Pattern sources (relative strengths and wavelength offsets only):
#   GES    Gaia-ESO line list v6, Heiter et al. 2021, A&A 645, A106
#          (Korg artifact Heiter_2021_GES_linelist, file Heiter_et_al_2021.h5)
#   KURUCZ Kurucz gfhyperall hyper250055.dat (Mn I), hyper290063/065.dat (Cu I)
#          http://kurucz.harvard.edu/linelists/gfhyperall/ (lines GES gives unsplit)
# Each line keeps the total log gf and the air wavelength of lines_ab.dat:
#   comp_wl  = parent_wl + (src_wl_i - src_centroid_gf_weighted)
#   comp_lgf = parent_loggf + log10(gf_i / sum gf)
# so sum(10**comp_lgf) == 10**parent_loggf for every parent line.
# Generated by tools/build_hfs_linelist.py.
#
# parent_wl  comp_wl    EP     comp_lgf  ion   source
